  "overview": {
    "text": {
      "en": "Start a short Kyoto stay with the eastern temple streets. Kiyomizu-dera, Yasaka Pagoda and Yasaka-jinja fit a focused outing; with another day, consider a separate rail journey to Fushimi Inari. Respect worship spaces and residential lanes."
    },
