      "destinationId": "place:Q34600",
      "kind": "other",
      "text": {
        "en": "Kiyomizu-dera’s hillside setting and timber stage help explain the city’s temple landscape. Gion developed around Yasaka-jinja; its traditional entertainment culture is still part of a living neighbourhood."
      },
